      "falsifier": "a materialized same-kernel reference differs by at least 1e-10, any registered symmetry error reaches 1e-6, or the candidate materializes edge or node-pair state",
      "id": "C-301",
      "next_action": "retain the fixed-rank map until a separate accuracy packet compares ranks or learned scales",
