      "required_support": 3,
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The opt-in ten-feature/head spatial kernel is positive, O(3)-invariant, translation-invariant after graph normalization, permutation-equivariant, and exactly factorized without an edge list or node-pair tensor.",
      "uncertainty": "the finite degree-two feature map is a soft truncated spatial kernel, not an exact Gaussian or hard neighborhood cutoff"
    },
