        "state/output identity test",
        "parameter/state hashes",
        "coordinate and gradient tests"
      ],
      "required_support": 3,
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The spatial option is backward-compatible when disabled, adds no learned or persistent state when enabled, and supports the existing coordinate updater with finite gradients.",
